  "geometryBasis": "OpenStreetMap’s named Motahhari dome, exact adjacent park quadrilateral and public street edges locate the court, dome and western gate. A distinct Overture roof polygon surrounds the mapped dome. Other roof runs and portals are fitted to the mapped court using the published descriptions.",
